* The throne statue as a kind presence (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own
* script; owner, 2026-11-13: "I'd like the throne statue to emit good things,
* not fear and whatnot"; option 5 of those offered, calm and healing). Run by
* openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder); safe to repeat.
*
* The Shee statue on its throne in the west cave (its eyes 2 19 6 at about
* 1242,2049; the glowing parts 2 19 7 below them) had a timer that shouted
* Fear Increase (chemical 27) and Loneliness Increase (25) to every creature
* within 700 px, twice as much with a norn in sight, with a gong, lit eyes and
* its threat at 255. Its timer script is replaced:
* - calm across the cave (500 px): Fear Decrease (44) 30 and Loneliness
*   Decrease (42) 20, every 2 s;
* - healing close by (within 250 px across of the statue, on the cave's
*   floor): Pain Decrease (35) 25 and Injury Decrease (48) 10, every 2 s;
* - while a creature is close the eyes and the glow are lit, with a soft
*   chime (the triangle's sound, tri_) as they light; no threat at all.
* OV00 is 1 while lit.

scrp 2 19 6 9
  setv thrt 0
  setv rnge 500
  stim shou 100 255 0 0 44 30 42 20 0 0 0 0
  setv var0 0
  enum 4 0 0
    setv var1 posx
    subv var1 1266
    doif var1 lt 0
      negv var1
    endi
    doif var1 lt 250 and posy gt 1900 and posy lt 2320
      stim writ targ 100 255 0 0 35 25 48 10 0 0 0 0
      setv var0 1
    endi
  next
  targ ownr
  doif var0 eq 1
    doif ov00 eq 0
      snde tri_
      setv ov00 1
      pose 1
      enum 2 19 7 pose 1 next
    endi
  else
    doif ov00 eq 1
      setv ov00 0
      targ ownr
      pose 0
      enum 2 19 7 pose 0 next
    endi
  endi
  targ ownr
endm

enum 2 19 6
  setv thrt 0
  setv ov00 0
  pose 0
  tick 20
next
enum 2 19 7 pose 0 next
